# The item-cost confirm page (ui/confirm/ItemCostConfirmPage), shown before something takes a player's items: its
# button's default words, its close button, and the line saying what the button takes. In uses.one, {0} is the
# item's own name and {1} how many; uses.many stands for a price of several items. key replaces that line when an
# item the player holds pays it all and stays theirs, {0} its own name.
confirm.button = Confirm
confirm.close = Close
confirm.uses.one = Uses {0} x{1, number} from your bag.
confirm.uses.many = Uses the items above from your bag.
confirm.key = Your {0} is not used up.

